Here is a `.gitignore` tailored for this Rust and eBPF workspace:

```gitignore
# Rust build artifacts
/target/
**/*.rs.bk

# Cargo temporary files
*.cargo-ok

# Local configuration overrides & secret tokens
*.local.toml
sloth.local.toml

# Operational logs & traces
*.log
logs/

# eBPF / temporary compilation binaries
*.o
*.bin

# Editor & IDE directories
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS artifacts
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
```